 "note": "Traced from the photo the campground's lanes, none of which was drawn: the west spine and its side lanes (past 17 to 25 and 19), the east lane from the county road round to the north (past 01 to 09), and the lanes past 06, 07 and 08 (rollout midwest). Checked over the lidar intensity, which shows every lane as a dark asphalt band: the spine, the east lane and the side lanes by 19 and 25 moved onto their bands' middles, and three short lanes (by 23, 06 and 08) that sat 4 to 12 m off any band dropped. Not drawn: the outer west lane, the inner loops round 14 to 16 and 10 to 13, and the lane north to GS2."
